OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK government approves Jackdaw gas
OL,4,Afield and says production will start
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FJackdaw was approved by the
OL,8,FConservative government in 2022, but
OL,9,Fwas delayed by legal challenges from
OL,10,Fenvironmental campaigners - here's a
OL,11,Fbrief history and here's a reminder of
OL,12,Fthe UK and Scotland's net zero targets
OL,14,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski calls
OL,15,Fthe Jackdaw decision "climate
OL,16,Fvandalism", adding: "This is a victory
OL,17,Ffor Shell over the people"
OL,19,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch backs
OL,20,Fthe decision, but accuses the
OL,21,Fgovernment of "faffing about"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
